# proves AtomVec::pack_comm_vel / pack_border_vel tested mask[i], the position in
# the send list, instead of mask[j], the atom.  The fix deform velocity remap was
# therefore applied to an unrelated set of ghost atoms.  Needs remap v AND a deform
# group that is not "all" -- with group all every mask matches and nothing shows.
units           lj
atom_style      atomic
lattice         fcc 0.8442
region          box block 0 6 0 6 0 6
create_box      2 box
create_atoms    1 box
region          half block 0 3 INF INF INF INF
set             region half type 2
group           moving type 2
mass            * 1.0
velocity        all create 1.0 87287 loop geom
pair_style      lj/cut 2.5
pair_coeff      * * 1.0 1.0 2.5
neighbor        0.3 bin
neigh_modify    delay 0 every 1 check no
comm_modify     vel yes
fix             1 all nve
fix             2 all deform 1 x scale 1.05 remap v units box
compute         tm moving temp
thermo_style    custom step temp c_tm epair press
thermo          25
run             50
